WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.13 · Marketing & Communications
Measuring communications performance

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Measure whether people did what you needed, not only how many saw it.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Give each objective one outcome measure.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Ask “How did you hear about us?” every time.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Review regularly and change one thing at a time.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Target 10 mentors, 8 trained. Most came via universities, few via Facebook. Next year: start with universities earlier.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create measures for each objective and a review routine.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
